00:39:19,721 --> 00:39:21,679
Me ...

274
00:39:23,099 --> 00:39:25,010
and Hana .

275
00:39:27,561 --> 00:39:29,556
Who 's Hana ?

276
00:39:33,527 --> 00:39:37,063
Żaneta , my honey !

277
00:39:38,197 --> 00:39:40,275
You 've had enough , mate !

278
00:39:42,327 --> 00:39:44,784
'Hana ' is what I call the digger .

279
00:39:46,331 --> 00:39:51,289
Thank you father , thank you mother .

280
00:39:52,336 --> 00:39:57,000
You brought me up beautifully .

281
00:39:58,342 --> 00:40:02,342
It 's time for me to leave .

282
00:40:04,224 --> 00:40:11,972
Bless me as I can 't come back now ...

283
00:40:21,115 --> 00:40:23,324
The bride and groom !

284
00:40:28,373 --> 00:40:30,331
Was Hana an old girlfriend ?

285
00:40:31,001 --> 00:40:33,125
Planning to cheat on me already ?

286
00:40:34,045 --> 00:40:35,530
No ... really ...

287
00:40:35,630 --> 00:40:37,541
Where 's the ring ?

288
00:40:38,550 --> 00:40:40,509
I think I know where you left it .

289
00:40:41,552 --> 00:40:44,472
- Everything OK ? - Yes ... I feel a bit strange ...

290
00:40:45,807 --> 00:40:47,266
Alcohol .

291
00:40:47,559 --> 00:40:50,431
Polish wedding ... You 'd better dance it off .

292
00:40:51,355 --> 00:40:54,090
Żaneta , I have to tell you something .

293
00:40:54,190 --> 00:40:56,766
Now the groom will dance with the happy mother-in-law !

294
00:40:57,193 --> 00:40:58,971
Change your partners !

295
00:40:59,070 --> 00:41:00,780
No , no , no ...

296
00:41:00,905 --> 00:41:03,114
No excuses ... It 's important .

297
00:41:05,619 --> 00:41:07,896
Well , the bride groom 's spinning his mother-in-law around .

298
00:41:07,996 --> 00:41:11,367
The first and last time . Poor old mother-in-laws .

299
00:41:12,208 --> 00:41:13,693
What 's going on ?

300
00:41:13,793 --> 00:41:16,369
I told them not to overdo it with the booze .

301
00:41:17,797 --> 00:41:22,793
When they serve you tell them the best man will take it off your hands .

302
00:41:26,264 --> 00:41:28,934
Change partners again !

303
00:41:32,103 --> 00:41:34,061
The bride is waiting ...

304
00:42:23,239 --> 00:42:25,315
I have a question ...

305
00:42:30,621 --> 00:42:32,398
Is it possible ...

306
00:42:32,498 --> 00:42:34,456
that the spirit of a dead person ...

307
00:42:38,880 --> 00:42:41,574
can appear before us ?

308
00:42:41,673 --> 00:42:43,253
How do you mean ?

309
00:42:43,675 --> 00:42:45,469
Normally ...

310
00:42:50,557 --> 00:42:53,726
There 's a spirit ...

311
00:42:55,605 --> 00:42:58,358
and I can see it .

312
00:42:59,608 --> 00:43:02,610
You mean the memory of a loved one ?

313
00:43:07,492 --> 00:43:09,449
I know it sounds stupid , but ...

314
00:43:46,489 --> 00:43:49,266
What 's this , Father ? Managed to sin already ?

315
00:43:49,367 --> 00:43:51,478
I 'm sorry , I have to go ...

316
00:43:51,577 --> 00:43:56,483
Please sit , Father , please ... I 'll come with a bottle in a minute .

317
00:43:56,583 --> 00:43:58,909
But first a swift one with my son-in-law .

318
00:43:59,918 --> 00:44:02,208
I can hardly talk to my son-in-law .

319
00:44:02,338 --> 00:44:06,039
Either not around or talking to somebody else .

320
00:44:06,550 --> 00:44:09,304
We have to get to know each other !

321
00:44:11,597 --> 00:44:13,092
But it 's like drinking .

322
00:44:13,724 --> 00:44:15,552
Only with your head not with an appetizer .

323
00:44:18,021 --> 00:44:20,673
You should watch your mouth after you had a few .

324
00:44:20,773 --> 00:44:22,351
Once it 's out it 's too late .

325
00:44:22,692 --> 00:44:26,358
People start whispering and you don 't even know who started it .

326
00:44:26,612 --> 00:44:27,942
It 's the butterfly effect .

327
00:44:30,742 --> 00:44:35,286
There 's a theory : if a butterfly flaps its wings somewhere ,

328
00:44:35,413 --> 00:44:37,440
it can cause a disaster .

329
00:44:37,541 --> 00:44:39,250
Get out , get out !

330
00:44:42,336 --> 00:44:46,253
- Do you know anything more ... - What about ?

331
00:44:47,759 --> 00:44:49,918
About that skeleton .

332
00:44:50,594 --> 00:44:53,965
You see how it sounds , depending on what words you use .

333
00:44:55,726 --> 00:44:58,394
Then you 'll say you didn 't mean it .

334
00:44:59,271 --> 00:45:01,394
But no one will hear you .

335
00:45:01,856 --> 00:45:04,230
I know what I saw .

336
00:45:05,485 --> 00:45:06,862
You saw it .

337
00:45:07,320 --> 00:45:08,731
But I didn 't .

338
00:45:15,661 --> 00:45:18,315
... and you bridesmaids take off your veils .

339
00:45:18,414 --> 00:45:21,617
Just don 't ruin your hair ...

340
00:45:34,681 --> 00:45:36,639
Make way !

341
00:45:40,436 --> 00:45:44,981
And this morning by the church bells were chiming ...

342
00:45:46,235 --> 00:45:47,969
Let 's roll him !

343
00:45:48,070 --> 00:45:50,277
Just leave him .

344
00:45:56,704 --> 00:45:58,079
Get ready .

345
00:45:58,539 --> 00:45:59,998
Except you , kid .

346
00:46:02,501 --> 00:46:04,244
You can 't either , dear uncle .

347
00:46:12,302 --> 00:46:14,342
Jasny ! Jasny !

348
00:46:19,976 --> 00:46:21,353
Doctor !

349
00:46:23,188 --> 00:46:24,547
Piotr , it 's fine .

350
00:46:24,648 --> 00:46:28,177
- We ought to take him . Just in case . - Don 't worry , boys . I 'll look after him .

351
00:46:28,277 --> 00:46:30,637
You can 't take the groom away from his wedding .

352
00:46:30,737 --> 00:46:33,556
It 's just epilepsy . Nothing serious .

353
00:46:33,657 --> 00:46:35,226
Żaneta , has he had any attacks before ?

354
00:46:35,326 --> 00:46:36,811
No , never ...

355
00:46:36,911 --> 00:46:38,869
I mean ... Not since I 've known him .

356
00:46:39,204 --> 00:46:41,873
You haven 't known each other long ...

357
00:46:42,875 --> 00:46:44,702
Jasny , come here .

358
00:46:46,211 --> 00:46:47,905
Listen , go and fetch more vodka from the car .

359
00:46:48,005 --> 00:46:51,659
We 'll have to get everyone drunk . They can 't see the groom like this .

360
00:46:51,759 --> 00:46:52,827
- How many bottles ? - All of them !

361
00:46:52,927 --> 00:46:55,579
- Why all of ... - I said all of them !

362
00:46:55,679 --> 00:46:56,628
Ronaldo !

363
00:46:57,806 --> 00:46:59,681
Have them turn off that siren !

364
00:47:05,231 --> 00:47:07,592
- Off you go , boys . - Are you sure you 're up to ... ?

365
00:47:07,692 --> 00:47:12,387
Look at me . He 's in the care of a doctor .

366
00:47:12,487 --> 00:47:16,474
When the stimulants kick in he 'll be as quiet as a lamb .

367
00:47:16,574 --> 00:47:18,534
Have a good party ...

368
00:47:20,121 --> 00:47:23,206
No use getting emotional .

369
00:47:24,666 --> 00:47:27,454
Piotr ...

370
00:47:29,297 --> 00:47:30,489
He 's not responding .

371
00:47:30,590 --> 00:47:33,626
Give him time , Żaneta . He had a double dose .

372
00:47:34,510 --> 00:47:35,327
It needs time .

373
00:47:35,427 --> 00:47:38,998
He drank too much and maybe took something .

374
00:47:39,097 --> 00:47:43,726
We shouldn 't take a blood test , it might cause problems , I reckon .

375
00:47:44,811 --> 00:47:47,101
Piotr , is it OK ?

376
00:47:47,606 --> 00:47:48,757
I 'll be back ...

377
00:47:48,858 --> 00:47:54,362
Go on ! Don 't worry about a thing . Have fun !

378
00:47:56,282 --> 00:47:58,608
Don 't worry , don 't worry ...

379
00:48:02,663 --> 00:48:04,786
Relax , relax .

380
00:48:09,836 --> 00:48:11,795
I won 't offer it to you ...

381
00:48:15,300 --> 00:48:17,202
Take it ! And hurry up !

382
00:48:17,302 --> 00:48:18,204
What did you give him ?

383
00:48:18,304 --> 00:48:20,547
- I didn 't give him anything .. - Yeah , right !

384
00:48:22,976 --> 00:48:24,626
Maybe he had something he took .

385
00:48:24,726 --> 00:48:26,295
- I swear . - Fuck your promises .

386
00:48:26,396 --> 00:48:28,554
A stupid joke of yours .

387
00:48:29,231 --> 00:48:32,092
Even if I had something , he wouldn 't have taken it .

388
00:48:32,193 --> 00:48:33,427
He doesn 't even drink much .

389
00:48:33,527 --> 00:48:36,764
- Great . What 's up with him then ? - I don 't fucking know .

390
00:48:36,864 --> 00:48:38,349
I 've never seen him like this .

391
00:48:38,449 --> 00:48:40,608
Where the fuck are you going ? Fuck this !

392
00:48:48,668 --> 00:48:50,626
Don 't you dare lie !

393
00:48:54,632 --> 00:48:56,092
False alarm .

394
00:48:56,885 --> 00:49:00,579
Everything 's fine . It 's under control .

395
00:49:00,679 --> 00:49:02,206
Faster , faster !

396
00:49:02,306 --> 00:49:04,632
As Piotr would say ...

397
00:49:08,146 --> 00:49:09,771
Hurry up ! Move !

398
00:49:11,565 --> 00:49:14,427
I 've put almost everything out . I left a few . For a rainy day .

399
00:49:14,527 --> 00:49:16,804
Isn 't it fucking rainy enough ?

400
00:49:16,905 --> 00:49:19,148
Well ? Start using your brain after thirty years .

401
00:49:19,907 --> 00:49:21,184
What 's your problem ?

402
00:49:21,284 --> 00:49:23,603
You found a fucked-up husband for you sister !

403
00:49:23,702 --> 00:49:25,199
That 's the problem .

404
00:49:25,413 --> 00:49:26,815
So it 's all my fault now .

405
00:49:26,914 --> 00:49:27,773
Whose is it ?

406
00:49:27,873 --> 00:49:29,867
Can 't you see he 's epileptic ?

407
00:49:30,085 --> 00:49:31,570
How was I supposed to know ?

408
00:49:31,670 --> 00:49:32,945
How were you supposed to know ?

409
00:49:33,045 --> 00:49:35,668
How the fuck are you supposed to know anything ?

410
00:49:35,923 --> 00:49:37,826
How much vodka are we left with ?

411
00:49:37,925 --> 00:49:39,619
- Come dance ! - Hurry up !

412
00:49:39,719 --> 00:49:44,429
- You got your duties as the best man ! - Wanna dance ? We 'll dance !

413
00:49:51,148 --> 00:49:53,106
Where ?

414
00:49:54,400 --> 00:49:56,344
Here ?

415
00:49:56,445 --> 00:49:58,402
That 's what he said .

416
00:49:59,947 --> 00:50:01,858
Really ?

417
00:50:04,952 --> 00:50:07,481
I don 't know . Maybe he was making it up .

418
00:50:07,581 --> 00:50:10,914
Didn 't you see how he was behaving ?

419
00:50:13,961 --> 00:50:16,715
Why didn 't anybody tell me ?

420
00:50:17,757 --> 00:50:21,092
But I thought you knew .

421
00:50:26,016 --> 00:50:27,501
If it was me ...

422
00:50:27,601 --> 00:50:30,389
I 'd have told you right away .

423
00:51:49,891 --> 00:51:52,264
Keep playing !

424
00:51:56,065 --> 00:51:57,346
Help him !

425
00:53:03,340 --> 00:53:06,452
Ok , ok . I mean not OK . That was a heavy dose .

426
00:53:06,552 --> 00:53:11,380
All right ... He 's not exactly well but we 'll figure it out .

427
00:53:12,141 --> 00:53:14,960
Where 's that bloody son of mine ?

428
00:53:15,061 --> 00:53:17,672
Piotr please tell me how can I help you ?

429
00:53:17,771 --> 00:53:19,681
Żaneta ! Be careful !

430
00:53:20,148 --> 00:53:22,059
Give him the fucking injection !

431
00:53:22,610 --> 00:53:24,686
Haste makes waste .

432
00:53:29,157 --> 00:53:30,617
Go on !

433
00:53:37,125 --> 00:53:39,083
Now hold him steady .

434
00:53:50,762 --> 00:53:53,137
What 's that ? Is he talking German ?

435
00:53:54,391 --> 00:53:56,126
Talking in ... Foreign languages ...

436
00:53:56,226 --> 00:53:58,304
Taiwan !

437
00:53:58,438 --> 00:54:00,230
Go away !

438
00:54:02,692 --> 00:54:04,844
Why 's the bloody priest here ?

439
00:54:04,943 --> 00:54:06,596
- I thought ... - What ? What did you think with ?

440
00:54:06,695 --> 00:54:09,474
- I 'm sorry ... - Piotrek found a skeleton in the ground .

441
00:54:09,574 --> 00:54:11,266
You fucking idiot !

442
00:54:11,367 --> 00:54:14,019
I didn 't tell her anything . Get off me , will you ?

443
00:54:14,119 --> 00:54:16,940
I came to say goodbye . I 've got work to do tomorrow .

444
00:54:17,039 --> 00:54:18,500
Listen ...

445
00:54:22,128 --> 00:54:24,371
There 's no skeleton .

446
00:54:26,423 --> 00:54:29,759
It 's the ravings of a sick mind .

447
00:54:30,010 --> 00:54:33,123
Żaneta , except no one 's seen it . Apart from him .

448
00:54:33,222 --> 00:54:35,375
Why don 't you ask him ?

449
00:54:35,474 --> 00:54:39,972
- What skeleton ? - It might be a spirit .

450
00:54:41,063 --> 00:54:42,257
He 's talking in a foreign language .

451
00:54:42,356 --> 00:54:46,927
He 's talking German . Big deal . He talks English too and even Polish .

452
00:54:47,027 --> 00:54:50,978
- That isn 't German . - Even better . He 's talking crap .

453
00:54:51,199 --> 00:54:52,141
Could you say something , Father ?

454
00:54:52,242 --> 00:54:54,994
Here we go !

455
00:54:57,621 --> 00:55:00,150
Well , the doctor said it 's epilepsy .

456
00:55:00,250 --> 00:55:05,208
I did - but I take it back . I 've never seen epilepsy like this , have you ?

457
00:55:06,255 --> 00:55:08,617
It must be possible to explain it from a medical point of view .

458
00:55:08,717 --> 00:55:11,077
Really ? How ? How do you explain it ?

459
00:55:11,177 --> 00:55:14,498
I don 't know ... Food poisoning , neurosis , psychosis perhaps .

460
00:55:14,597 --> 00:55:16,958
Esotericism might have something to say .

461
00:55:17,057 --> 00:55:17,876
Split personality .

462
00:55:17,976 --> 00:55:18,793
Schizophrenia .

463
00:55:18,893 --> 00:55:19,960
Multiple personality .

464
00:55:20,061 --> 00:55:21,755
Fascinating illness .

465
00:55:21,855 --> 00:55:24,967
The mind , emotions and motivations . All of this becomes fragmented .

466
00:55:25,067 --> 00:55:29,610
But cases like these don 't happen ... Do you understand ?

467
00:55:29,862 --> 00:55:33,777
And if they don 't , then the groom 's in fact possessed .

468
00:55:34,742 --> 00:55:36,286
Dears ... I 'll tell you ...

469
00:55:37,496 --> 00:55:40,699
It is suspected to be a case of food poisoning .

470
00:55:44,085 --> 00:55:48,739
Let me stress it has nothing to do with the food we 've been serving .

471
00:55:48,840 --> 00:55:53,202
It was something he ate earlier . Probably while he was still ...

472
00:55:53,302 --> 00:55:55,012
in London .

473
00:55:56,306 --> 00:56:02,346
The last thing Żaneta and Piotr want is for you to be worried about it .

474
00:56:03,521 --> 00:56:07,217
I fully understand your concern . My wife and I were afraid of what might happen ,

475
00:56:07,317 --> 00:56:10,219
but the doctor has calmed our nerves .

476
00:56:10,320 --> 00:56:14,271
As he has seen hundreds , maybe even thousands of such cases .

477
00:56:15,199 --> 00:56:18,561
As we were leaving , the groom was racing back here

478
00:56:18,661 --> 00:56:20,619
and actually wanted to dance .

479
00:56:21,331 --> 00:56:22,827
But I ...

480
00:56:23,876 --> 00:56:25,286
He needs to rest .

481
00:56:25,878 --> 00:56:28,369
Saint Michael , the Archangel , defend us in battle ,

482
00:56:30,340 --> 00:56:32,882
Be our defense against the wickedness and snares of the devil .

483
00:56:34,510 --> 00:56:36,304
May God rebuke him , we humbly pray .

484
00:56:43,353 --> 00:56:45,097
That 's Yiddish .

485
00:56:46,356 --> 00:56:48,315
- Yiddish ? - Yes .

486
00:56:49,525 --> 00:56:50,635
It 's too weak .

487
00:56:50,735 --> 00:56:53,358
We need something more powerful . Maybe try something in Latin ?

488
00:57:00,036 --> 00:57:01,152
Amen .

489
00:57:35,114 --> 00:57:37,072
Are you out of your fucking mind ?

490
00:57:37,407 --> 00:57:39,235
Let him go !

491
00:57:46,250 --> 00:57:49,320
Saint Michael , the Archangel , defend us in battle ...

492
00:57:49,420 --> 00:57:53,121
Be our defense against the wickedness ...

493
00:59:16,673 --> 00:59:18,418
Professor , please ...

494
00:59:24,264 --> 00:59:25,291
Yes ?

495
00:59:25,391 --> 00:59:27,467
What do you mean " yes " ? Open the bloody door .

496
00:59:27,851 --> 00:59:29,963
Let us in !

497
00:59:30,063 --> 00:59:31,972
Are you crazy ?

498
00:59:40,322 --> 00:59:41,699
Have you all gone fucking mad ?

499
00:59:42,409 --> 00:59:43,742
He 's been shouting his head off .

500
00:59:47,204 --> 00:59:50,483
Bring the band in , otherwise all the guests will come here if he keeps wailing .

501
00:59:50,583 --> 00:59:52,458
Professor , please ...

502
00:59:54,628 --> 00:59:56,503
Why drag him into this ?

503
00:59:57,840 --> 00:59:59,742
Leave us alone . Now !

504
00:59:59,842 --> 01:00:02,298
All right , all right ... As you wish .

505
01:00:06,266 --> 01:00:08,460
Father , may I have a word ?

506
01:00:08,559 --> 01:00:11,431
- I really have to go now . - Just a word !

507
01:00:14,690 --> 01:00:16,684
Guys , stay a bit longer ! Where 's your boss ?

508
01:00:19,570 --> 01:00:21,472
- Fuck ! - Not now !

509
01:00:21,572 --> 01:00:23,266
Just a few more songs !

510
01:00:23,365 --> 01:00:25,976
Everything 's packed away . What can we plug in there ?

511
01:00:26,077 --> 01:00:27,244
There was a contract . Right ?

512
01:00:27,369 --> 01:00:30,856
- With a timetable attached . Right ? - There was , but ...

513
01:00:30,956 --> 01:00:33,496
But what ? I want music and fun .

514
01:00:34,585 --> 01:00:36,211
Who pays the piper calls the tune .

515
01:00:41,635 --> 01:00:43,592
Who are you ?

516
01:00:59,360 --> 01:01:01,318
I 'm Hana .

517
01:01:09,788 --> 01:01:12,990
I knew only one Hana here .

518
01:01:14,626 --> 01:01:17,201
Everyone in the area courted her ...

519
01:01:18,630 --> 01:01:22,083
I was also in love with her ...

520
01:01:23,510 --> 01:01:27,923
We 'd bet about who would kiss her first ...

521
01:01:31,893 --> 01:01:36,472
I can still feel her cheek ...

522
01:01:37,690 --> 01:01:43,695
But she only loved one Polish boy ...

523
01:01:46,617 --> 01:01:52,407
Then she vanished without a trace .

524
01:01:58,670 --> 01:02:00,628
Who are you ?

525
01:02:07,012 --> 01:02:09,581
I 'm Szymon Wentz .

526
01:02:09,681 --> 01:02:12,221
I live in the house by the river .

527
01:02:15,813 --> 01:02:18,768
You 're little Szymon ?

528
01:02:25,322 --> 01:02:30,780
Under little Lilly 's cradle stands a pure white goat .

529
01:02:33,163 --> 01:02:36,615
The little goat went to market ,

530
01:02:37,333 --> 01:02:43,255
to buy you raisins and almonds .

531
01:03:06,364 --> 01:03:12,652
... so you would fall asleep , my little boy .

532
01:03:19,626 --> 01:03:22,498
What 's going on ? Nothing 's going on . Just a normal wedding .

533
01:03:23,755 --> 01:03:26,710
The weather isn 't up to much , so few things went wrong .

534
